### Netcup SCP API — Servers
# Server discovery and detail endpoints.

### List All Servers
GET {{base_url}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Find Server by Name
GET {{base_url}}/servers?name={{server_name}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Search Servers (free-text across name, nickname, IPv4)
GET {{base_url}}/servers?q=REPLACE_WITH_SEARCH_TERM
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Filter Servers by IP
GET {{base_url}}/servers?ip=REPLACE_WITH_IP_ADDRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Filter Servers by Firewall Policy
GET {{base_url}}/servers?firewallPolicyId={{policy_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List Servers with Pagination
GET {{base_url}}/servers?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Server Details
# Set loadServerLiveInfo=false for faster response without live VM state
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Server Details (skip live info)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}?loadServerLiveInfo=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
